        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1>Ice Anchor</h1><p><em>Its claws sink deep into the ice.</em></p><h2>Rules</h2><p><strong>ID:</strong> monster-rime-dragon-ice-anchor</p><p><strong>Action:</strong> Maneuver</p><p>Gain Stability 3 while on ice or solid ground until its next turn; highest source only.</p><p><strong>Limits:</strong> Costs its Maneuver; no extra action is granted.</p>"
